# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

onsite_headless_prototype
# Project documentation is kept local, not published to the remote. It holds raw
# scanner output (secsuite-run-40.pdf carries the leaked Braintree and
# Elasticsearch keys in its text), dated internal reports, and build references
# copied from the legacy app — none of which a checkout needs in order to build.
# Code-level conventions that DO need to travel live in AGENTS.md at the root.
/docs/
